{"name":"Hardcastle","status":"ok","title":"Hardcastle","pageId":7177,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Hardcastle_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Hardcastle (disambiguation)\">Hardcastle (disambiguation)</a>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-organization\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Hardcastle</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Basic Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"base\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base of<br>operations</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cormyr\" title=\"Cormyr\">Cormyr</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"allegiances\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Allegiances</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Obarskyr\" title=\"Obarskyr\">Obarskyrs</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Members_of_the_Hardcastle_family\" title=\"Category:Members of the Hardcastle family\">Members of the Hardcastle family</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Hardcastle</b> was a noble house of <a href=\"/wiki/Cormyr\" title=\"Cormyr\">Cormyr</a>. The family was loyal to the <a href=\"/wiki/Obarskyr\" title=\"Obarskyr\">Obarskyrs</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-DotD_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DotD-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Notable_Members\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Members</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Connections\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Connections</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Members\">Notable Members</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Members\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hardcastle?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Members\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ildamoar_Hardcastle\" title=\"Ildamoar Hardcastle\">Ildamoar Hardcastle</a>, hea